; Stationery · Launcher — the colours of its app-icon stand-in tiles. Original work, MIT licensed.
;
; Links and shortcuts have no icon of their own, so they get a tile the size of an app icon's body with a white
; symbol, like Apple's Shortcuts widget. A tile is a gradient from the Light look's system colour mixed 18 % toward
; white (Top) to it mixed 8 % toward black (Bottom), the same in every look, since icons keep their colour. Only these
; seven keep a white symbol readable (3:1 or more); LaunchColor<k> accepts their names.

